# Test area: the case board lab (story/boardlab.story). Godot only.
# SPOILERS: the whole solution, plus the wrong turns that cost you.

chapter boardlab
idle
expect @lab
#@ Board lab · start
nogo Bus stop
nogo Museum
# --- the restaurant: 아저씨 saw her this morning, and she got on the bus
spot Restaurant
choose Thank him
idle
expect @lab
# --- strings only go between pinned cards: a wrong one opens nothing; taking it down frays it
pin c_owner_bus p_sujin
link c_owner_bus p_sujin
nogo Bus stop
unlink c_owner_bus p_sujin
# --- what he said, pinned to the right things: the bus stop opens (silently)
link c_owner_bus p_halmeoni
pin pl_busstop
link c_owner_bus pl_busstop
spot Bus stop
idle
expect @lab&go_busstop
# --- 9 o'clock at the museum: the museum opens
pin c_text pl_museum
link c_text pl_museum
spot The shop
build 압정 | 주세요
number 1200
number 1000
idle
spot The shop
build 실 | 주세요
number 500
idle
pin t_nine
link c_text t_nine
spot Museum
idle
# --- telling 수진 before the board says it costs you her trust
spot Courtyard
choose Tell her
idle
expect !tolddone
# --- the whole morning on the board, then tell her
# --- out of string and tacks: the shop (ask in Korean, pay on the pad)
spot The shop
build 압정 | 주세요
number 1000
idle
spot The shop
build 실 | 주세요
number 500
idle
spot The shop
build 실 | 주세요
number 500
idle
pin c_owner_here pl_sikdang c_staff
link c_owner_here pl_sikdang
link c_staff pl_museum
expect knows_story
spot Courtyard
choose Tell her
idle
expect tolddone
